      "value": "Loading has gotten faster for me, but since loading is handled in a little pocket dimension, it would be very nice to be able to even be able to just point and click at random particles that appear. Literally anything would work here as you are already having the position of the hands (or mouse) tracked and ray-casted for the \"Go home\" button. Would be nice to have just about anything else to do.",
