  "details": "Please give us a mini-game or something to do in the loading screen. I love VR Chat but because my internet is slow I often spend 30% of my time playing in loading screens and wishing I had anything to do. Just a basic target shooting mini-game, or a basketball hoop to shoot at, or even just a ball to bounce off a wall would be my favorite new feature in VR Chat.",
